1
00:00:04,546 --> 00:00:08,049
AM 08:12 TST
TAIPEI

2
00:00:17,829 --> 00:00:23,579
"What are you prioritizing
over the lives of your loved ones?

3
00:00:25,829 --> 00:00:32,912
"You are on a fool's errand...
Carry out your missions immediately."

4
00:00:33,995 --> 00:00:36,704
They must know what we're up to.

5
00:00:36,829 --> 00:00:39,162
I bet they're watching us.

6
00:00:53,964 --> 00:00:56,401
I'm in the kiDnap GAME. Can we talk?

7
00:01:10,662 --> 00:01:15,048
I have two children.

8
00:01:15,288 --> 00:01:16,963
I do my best to balance

9
00:01:16,994 --> 00:01:22,276
housework and my career,
for all my fellow moms out there.

10
00:01:22,375 --> 00:01:24,369
YOU LOOK TIRED.

11
00:01:27,949 --> 00:01:28,542
Hi Papa!

12
00:01:34,873 --> 00:01:35,790
Hi Papa!

13
00:01:41,787 --> 00:01:43,870
ATRA
FLOWER SHOP

14
00:02:01,551 --> 00:02:02,303
Papa?

15
00:02:05,761 --> 00:02:06,536
Papa...?

16
00:02:08,955 --> 00:02:09,922
Papa?!

17
00:02:13,489 --> 00:02:17,155
That's great.

18
00:02:17,315 --> 00:02:19,730
Look down a little.

19
00:02:19,910 --> 00:02:22,296
That's it. Perfect.

20
00:02:22,814 --> 00:02:24,855
I'll be done in two hours.

21
00:02:27,330 --> 00:02:30,616
I told them it's an overnight shoot.

22
00:02:39,536 --> 00:02:40,968
I'm working.

23
00:02:41,776 --> 00:02:45,010
Papa's been... Papa's been kidnapped!

24
00:02:47,003 --> 00:02:47,769
What?

25
00:02:50,378 --> 00:02:50,870
Leona?!

26
00:02:56,323 --> 00:02:56,843
Papa...

27
00:03:00,990 --> 00:03:01,770
Leona...

28
00:03:03,683 --> 00:03:05,650
What's the kiDnap GAME?

29
00:03:05,932 --> 00:03:07,010
Why do you ask?

30
00:03:09,150 --> 00:03:10,483
Someone at school

31
00:03:11,150 --> 00:03:14,566
said Papa was kidnapped
in the kiDnap GAME.

32
00:03:15,191 --> 00:03:16,050
Ignore them.

33
00:03:17,162 --> 00:03:19,302
-But...
-Don't worry about it!

34
00:03:20,900 --> 00:03:23,358
TOSHI_RO
I'M IN THE KIDNAP GAME. CAN WE TALK?

35
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:35,691
LET'S MEET.

36
00:04:32,843 --> 00:04:36,066
KIDNAP GAME

37
00:04:38,110 --> 00:04:40,444
5 CONTESTANTS LEFT.

38
00:04:40,817 --> 00:04:45,192
5 DAYS AND 9 HOURS UNTIL THE GAME ENDS.

39
00:04:53,963 --> 00:04:55,380
She sent a message.

40
00:04:56,588 --> 00:04:58,297
She says "Let's meet."

41
00:04:58,508 --> 00:04:59,883
What changed?

42
00:05:00,922 --> 00:05:03,088
Maybe she replied because,

43
00:05:03,213 --> 00:05:06,547
like you, she's tasked with the impossible.

44
00:05:14,463 --> 00:05:19,130
Each mission is different,
but they're all very difficult.

45
00:05:19,255 --> 00:05:22,588
Your mission is to capture the mastermind.

46
00:05:22,713 --> 00:05:24,810
Not easy, even for a detective.

47
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:29,863
-In Manila, money.
-Impossible even by illegal means.

48
00:05:30,463 --> 00:05:33,505
In Bangkok, a politician's confession.

49
00:05:34,172 --> 00:05:35,963
Equally futile.

50
00:05:36,880 --> 00:05:41,150
In Singapore...
I think her mission's a chain of riddles.

51
00:05:41,175 --> 00:05:42,063
CHECKPOINT ONE CLEARED.

52
00:05:42,297 --> 00:05:45,172
It'll take a long time to solve them.

53
00:05:45,297 --> 00:05:46,588
AM 09:09 SGT
SINGAPORE

54
00:05:53,838 --> 00:05:55,213
Thank you!

55
00:06:01,031 --> 00:06:06,036
Your own mission would be a piece of cake
for a man who didn't value life.

56
00:06:06,097 --> 00:06:08,976
COMMIT MURDER

57
00:06:09,713 --> 00:06:14,047
But for you, it's unimaginably tough.

58
00:06:15,213 --> 00:06:18,880
You said you'd rescue all the hostages.

59
00:06:21,255 --> 00:06:24,297
But what if you could only rescue one?

60
00:06:31,213 --> 00:06:35,672
I would rescue Rian. My daughter.

61
00:06:40,422 --> 00:06:43,672
AM 11:02 JST
NAHA

62
00:06:47,570 --> 00:06:48,880
HACKING COMPLETE

63
00:06:50,009 --> 00:06:52,243
You need better security.

64
00:06:57,516 --> 00:06:59,172
Have you seen him?

65
00:06:59,297 --> 00:07:02,588
-Nah, never. You?
-Nope.

66
00:07:02,588 --> 00:07:02,797
TOKYO

67
00:07:02,797 --> 00:07:05,172
-Sorry, no.
-I see.

68
00:07:07,422 --> 00:07:08,650
What should I do...?

69
00:07:14,163 --> 00:07:17,690
I have two children.

70
00:07:18,476 --> 00:07:23,838
I do my best to balance

71
00:07:24,243 --> 00:07:29,763
housework and my career,
for all my fellow moms out there.

72
00:07:29,969 --> 00:07:32,830
-This one's the same...
-What?

73
00:07:33,783 --> 00:07:38,936
She often mentions her children
but never her husband.

74
00:07:40,116 --> 00:07:43,490
Could it be that they're on bad terms?

75
00:07:55,298 --> 00:07:56,756
You know the "kiDnap GAME"?

76
00:07:58,951 --> 00:08:00,517
It's a malicious rumor.

77
00:08:01,476 --> 00:08:06,583
Other hostages were murdered
when the missions failed, supposedly.

78
00:08:07,610 --> 00:08:12,883
We can't make progress
if the kidnapper's demands are kept secret.

79
00:08:16,256 --> 00:08:17,796
What do you mean?

80
00:08:18,409 --> 00:08:20,423
My husband is gone.
Why keep secrets?

81
00:08:22,470 --> 00:08:23,236
Where to?

82
00:08:24,203 --> 00:08:25,505
To pick up my son.

83
00:08:28,922 --> 00:08:33,088
PM 12:34 TST

84
00:08:48,270 --> 00:08:49,312
Yes...?

85
00:08:49,363 --> 00:08:51,154
Can you pick up Rui?

86
00:08:51,529 --> 00:08:54,279
Again...? Why can't you go?

87
00:08:54,463 --> 00:08:56,713
I've got a lot on my plate.

88
00:08:57,297 --> 00:08:58,422
Fine.

89
00:09:19,114 --> 00:09:22,031
YOU'RE BEING FOLLOWED. RUN!

90
00:09:33,422 --> 00:09:36,042
-Oh, my gosh! I'm so sorry.
-I'm OK.

91
00:09:36,067 --> 00:09:38,528
I wasn't looking. I was blind.

92
00:09:39,180 --> 00:09:42,033
Are you OK? Are you sure?

93
00:09:42,794 --> 00:09:43,835
Hey!

94
00:09:44,835 --> 00:09:46,377
Welcome.

95
00:09:53,919 --> 00:09:56,044
I'm Toshiro Niide, Tokyo.

96
00:09:57,210 --> 00:09:58,877
I'm Christina Lin.

97
00:10:03,383 --> 00:10:07,210
Thanks for your help.
How did you know I was being followed?

98
00:10:07,533 --> 00:10:10,216
Experience. I'm detective.

99
00:10:11,835 --> 00:10:13,356
That makes sense.

100
00:10:23,970 --> 00:10:26,252
I’m Han Kiju from Seoul, Korea.

101
00:10:27,282 --> 00:10:28,696
I'm Christina Lin.

102
00:10:35,981 --> 00:10:40,169
-We don’t have much time, so let’s cut to the chase.
-Sure.

103
00:10:40,835 --> 00:10:45,252
I was given a mission to capture the mastermind.
Were you given a mission?

104
00:10:47,675 --> 00:10:48,402
Yes.

105
00:10:50,189 --> 00:10:53,630
Could you hold off completing it and work with us?

106
00:10:54,670 --> 00:10:57,316
They’ll kill my husband. I can’t abandon him.

107
00:10:57,842 --> 00:11:00,752
I’ll capture the mastermind. I just need your help.

108
00:11:01,116 --> 00:11:03,298
Are you trying to complete your own mission first?

109
00:11:03,323 --> 00:11:06,256
No! I’m trying to rescue the hostages. All of them.

110
00:11:07,198 --> 00:11:08,532
I’m asking for your help.

111
00:11:10,282 --> 00:11:14,690
At this rate, another hostage will die.
More people will suffer.

112
00:11:19,990 --> 00:11:22,790
He's right. He saved my life.

113
00:11:26,063 --> 00:11:29,896
I think cooperation’s our best bet right now.

114
00:11:32,532 --> 00:11:38,073
My mission... is to commit murder.

115
00:11:39,282 --> 00:11:45,073
I believe you’re here because
you also received an impossible demand.

116
00:11:45,698 --> 00:11:50,069
In which case, could you help us?

117
00:11:52,176 --> 00:11:53,490
Please.

118
00:12:00,407 --> 00:12:03,782
My mission was the same. Kill someone.

119
00:12:06,907 --> 00:12:08,532
I could never do that.

120
00:12:11,573 --> 00:12:13,157
I’ll cooperate,

121
00:12:13,282 --> 00:12:18,115
if it means saving my husband...
saving everyone else!

122
00:12:22,532 --> 00:12:23,407
We will.

123
00:12:26,782 --> 00:12:30,198
Do you have any ideas on
who the mastermind might be?

124
00:12:31,407 --> 00:12:32,240
No.

125
00:12:32,365 --> 00:12:33,865
No idea why you were chosen?

126
00:12:34,490 --> 00:12:36,073
I have no idea.

127
00:12:39,323 --> 00:12:42,157
I have to go, before they’ll get suspicious.

128
00:12:42,365 --> 00:12:45,365
If I think of anything, I'll let you know.

129
00:12:46,323 --> 00:12:47,198
Wait.

130
00:12:50,407 --> 00:12:52,573
Have we met before somewhere?

131
00:12:54,657 --> 00:12:55,490
No.

132
00:12:56,948 --> 00:12:59,698
Maybe it's because I'm a model.

133
00:13:02,032 --> 00:13:02,865
Maybe.

134
00:13:05,157 --> 00:13:06,782
I really have to go.

135
00:13:22,490 --> 00:13:24,490
That was an act.

136
00:13:24,948 --> 00:13:27,573
-She lied about her mission.
-Yeah.

137
00:13:29,894 --> 00:13:33,143
She has her guard up.

138
00:13:34,115 --> 00:13:37,925
She might see us as rivals...
or even as enemies.

139
00:13:38,865 --> 00:13:40,657
What's she planning?

140
00:13:41,073 --> 00:13:45,490
She may try to throw us off
and complete her mission.

141
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:01,782
Listen closely.

142
00:14:03,115 --> 00:14:06,198
There are two men following us.

143
00:14:06,782 --> 00:14:09,448
-Police?
-I doubt it.

144
00:14:10,038 --> 00:14:11,490
The mastermind's men?

145
00:14:11,615 --> 00:14:14,198
If so, I'll make them talk.

146
00:14:14,523 --> 00:14:16,523
Keep an eye on her.

147
00:14:43,365 --> 00:14:44,948
What do you want?

148
00:15:05,755 --> 00:15:07,621
What do you want with her?

149
00:15:55,089 --> 00:15:58,883
Who are you?! Who sent you?!

150
00:16:13,490 --> 00:16:14,823
Hey!

151
00:16:19,407 --> 00:16:20,657
Damn.

152
00:16:33,076 --> 00:16:34,073
Kiju.

153
00:16:36,178 --> 00:16:38,692
-How'd it go?
-They got away.

154
00:16:42,030 --> 00:16:43,032
You okay?

155
00:16:54,663 --> 00:16:55,510
Thanks.

156
00:16:57,247 --> 00:16:58,776
Who were they?

157
00:16:59,913 --> 00:17:02,913
-Mama!
-Rui!

158
00:17:03,038 --> 00:17:05,913
-I missed you.
-I missed you too!

159
00:17:07,080 --> 00:17:08,205
Thank you.

160
00:17:08,830 --> 00:17:10,038
Where were you?

161
00:17:10,580 --> 00:17:11,376
I was...

162
00:17:14,156 --> 00:17:16,455
What were you doing?

163
00:17:16,997 --> 00:17:20,330
-Stop keeping secrets!
-Come back, Leona!

164
00:17:21,122 --> 00:17:22,372
Watch them.

165
00:17:26,705 --> 00:17:29,580
-Are you okay?
-Yes, thank you.

166
00:17:31,122 --> 00:17:35,247
Make sure you're dressed
so you're not cold.

167
00:17:35,372 --> 00:17:36,205
I'm okay.

168
00:18:07,913 --> 00:18:09,997
The scene of the crime.

169
00:18:18,080 --> 00:18:19,163
Papa?

170
00:18:32,955 --> 00:18:34,080
I'm sorry...

171
00:18:35,038 --> 00:18:36,372
You all right?

172
00:18:39,788 --> 00:18:43,163
Wait... wait! Are you the Tokyo man?

173
00:18:45,788 --> 00:18:49,038
You’re the policeman whose wife was kidnapped!

174
00:18:52,038 --> 00:18:54,580
-How do you...
-Wait.

175
00:18:55,288 --> 00:18:56,247
Look!

176
00:19:00,247 --> 00:19:02,997
Why are you here? To meet Mom?

177
00:19:04,705 --> 00:19:07,830
Answer me! I only want to save my Papa!

178
00:19:08,872 --> 00:19:12,872
Mom’s in the game too, right?
Are they telling her to do something?

179
00:19:13,330 --> 00:19:15,788
Will that save Papa?
What are they telling her to do?

180
00:19:17,580 --> 00:19:19,622
Sorry. I don’t know.

181
00:19:22,310 --> 00:19:26,816
I’d like to know her mission myself.
You don’t have any idea?

182
00:19:29,580 --> 00:19:32,913
Since Papa was kidnapped,

183
00:19:33,747 --> 00:19:37,372
-Mom’s been secretly calling this guy.
-Guy?

184
00:19:37,497 --> 00:19:40,330
Kevin -- my piano tutor.

185
00:19:40,455 --> 00:19:43,372
She asked him about a video.

186
00:19:44,230 --> 00:19:46,650
You deleted the video, right?

187
00:19:47,528 --> 00:19:48,490
That's okay, then...

188
00:19:49,330 --> 00:19:50,580
A video?

189
00:19:52,016 --> 00:19:55,090
But, why do you need to know what her mission is?

190
00:19:56,336 --> 00:20:00,415
Are you trying to stop her?
If you stop her, Papa will be killed!

191
00:20:00,440 --> 00:20:04,083
-No, no. That’s not what I’m trying to do!
-No, no. Stay away from me!

192
00:20:07,723 --> 00:20:10,663
My mission was the same. Kill someone.

193
00:20:10,914 --> 00:20:12,831
That was an act.

194
00:20:13,205 --> 00:20:14,538
She lied.

195
00:20:14,743 --> 00:20:16,577
Are they telling her to do something?

196
00:20:17,110 --> 00:20:19,583
Will that save Papa? What are they telling her to do?

197
00:20:33,538 --> 00:20:38,038
EXPOSE THE SEX VIDEO
WITH YOUR AFFAIR PARTNER TO THE LIGHT OF DAY

198
00:21:00,149 --> 00:21:01,065
What is it?

199
00:21:02,955 --> 00:21:04,080
What's this?

200
00:21:06,788 --> 00:21:08,872
A record of our love.

201
00:21:08,997 --> 00:21:10,538
Don't bullshit me!

202
00:21:10,705 --> 00:21:12,455
And your beauty, too.

203
00:21:15,538 --> 00:21:18,705
Delete it!

204
00:21:36,056 --> 00:21:37,747
Is this the first time?

205
00:21:38,622 --> 00:21:39,538
Of course.

206
00:21:41,580 --> 00:21:44,622
Hey.

207
00:21:47,913 --> 00:21:49,330
Trust me.

208
00:21:50,436 --> 00:21:52,955
That was the first and the last.

209
00:21:54,497 --> 00:21:58,913
From now on, I'm only recording you
with these eyes.

210
00:22:20,538 --> 00:22:21,663
Hi, Kevin.

211
00:22:22,705 --> 00:22:26,330
Christina... What's the matter?

212
00:22:27,997 --> 00:22:32,080
Sorry to keep bothering you.
About that video...

213
00:22:32,205 --> 00:22:35,536
That again? You saw me delete it.

214
00:22:36,763 --> 00:22:39,450
That was the only one, right?

215
00:22:40,176 --> 00:22:42,463
Of course it was. Trust me.

216
00:22:44,855 --> 00:22:45,850
I do, but...

217
00:22:46,389 --> 00:22:48,139
Something worrying you?

218
00:22:51,263 --> 00:22:52,723
Anything I can do?

219
00:22:55,492 --> 00:22:59,247
No, it's okay...
Your voice makes me feel better.

220
00:23:00,087 --> 00:23:04,900
Well, if something comes up, let me know.
I'd do anything for you.

221
00:23:06,296 --> 00:23:08,503
Thanks. I'll call again.

222
00:23:57,788 --> 00:24:00,455
Emergency patient, Dr. Han.

223
00:24:04,510 --> 00:24:05,830
Japanese?

224
00:24:07,810 --> 00:24:08,913
Tokyo?

225
00:24:12,430 --> 00:24:13,098
5 YEARS AGO

226
00:24:13,123 --> 00:24:14,580
A brain tumor?!

227
00:24:15,370 --> 00:24:18,770
She might not only go blind.
She may even die.

228
00:24:19,289 --> 00:24:20,702
No...

229
00:24:21,716 --> 00:24:25,650
Please, you have to save her!

230
00:24:27,996 --> 00:24:33,705
Yes, of course. I'll return to Seoul at once.
I'll make sure she pulls through this.

231
00:24:34,577 --> 00:24:37,243
Emergency patient, Dr. Han.

232
00:24:38,616 --> 00:24:39,616
Doctor?!

233
00:24:48,706 --> 00:24:50,914
Please! Save my child!

234
00:24:51,285 --> 00:24:52,952
Please wait your turn.

235
00:24:53,077 --> 00:24:54,452
No! He needs help!

236
00:24:54,827 --> 00:24:57,577
Look at him! He spilled hot water on himself.

237
00:24:57,702 --> 00:25:01,452
What if it leaves scars?
Are you going to responsible for this?

238
00:25:01,577 --> 00:25:03,160
Others are waiting.

239
00:25:03,224 --> 00:25:06,630
Please, you have to save her!

240
00:25:07,077 --> 00:25:12,363
Save my child. Right now, please.

241
00:25:12,388 --> 00:25:14,555
-Others are waiting.
-Doctor?

242
00:25:14,868 --> 00:25:16,077
I'll examine him.

243
00:25:16,577 --> 00:25:18,493
Thank you so much.

244
00:25:20,952 --> 00:25:26,618
What about the emergency patient, Dr. Han?

245
00:25:33,993 --> 00:25:35,868
What's wrong, Kiju?

246
00:25:38,910 --> 00:25:41,993
I remembered how I met her.

247
00:25:42,410 --> 00:25:43,910
Christina?

248
00:25:45,493 --> 00:25:49,285
Yes, I treated her son
five years ago, in Tokyo.

249
00:25:50,410 --> 00:25:54,035
Five years ago? In Tokyo?

250
00:25:54,743 --> 00:25:57,452
My mind was on Rian.

251
00:25:58,202 --> 00:26:00,577
That's why I didn't remember.

252
00:26:01,118 --> 00:26:04,577
Anything else you remember?
Just her son?

253
00:26:05,993 --> 00:26:07,868
My memory's hazy.

254
00:26:10,452 --> 00:26:13,868
Give me some time. I'll look it up.

255
00:26:14,993 --> 00:26:16,785
All right. Thanks.

256
00:26:23,202 --> 00:26:24,910
Five years ago...

257
00:26:26,827 --> 00:26:29,660
Put your anger aside.
Show me your kindness...

258
00:26:30,035 --> 00:26:33,243
Kindness that shields the weak...

259
00:26:33,910 --> 00:26:39,156
That's the right thing for you to do.

260
00:27:00,243 --> 00:27:01,368
What's wrong?

261
00:27:04,202 --> 00:27:07,535
He's outside.
The kiDnap GAME participant.

262
00:27:09,243 --> 00:27:11,910
He asked me about you.

263
00:27:13,535 --> 00:27:18,618
What's your mission, Mom?
What do you have to do to get Papa back?

264
00:27:21,835 --> 00:27:23,294
Answer me!

265
00:27:23,788 --> 00:27:27,371
Is Kevin involved somehow?
What's the video?

266
00:27:31,743 --> 00:27:32,910
He's not...

267
00:27:33,035 --> 00:27:35,785
I already know everything, okay?!

268
00:27:40,769 --> 00:27:42,676
Why do you think I quit piano?

269
00:27:44,010 --> 00:27:49,397
So you wouldn't see Kevin anymore!

270
00:27:51,083 --> 00:27:53,636
He's not the man you think he is.

271
00:27:54,070 --> 00:27:56,303
He took a pass at me, too.

272
00:28:04,993 --> 00:28:10,830
That can't be true...

273
00:28:10,888 --> 00:28:12,828
You only ever think about yourself.

274
00:28:14,603 --> 00:28:18,743
No, I don't. I've always done my best.

275
00:28:19,283 --> 00:28:22,256
For our family. To be a good mother.

276
00:28:22,320 --> 00:28:24,616
All for yourself!

277
00:28:31,543 --> 00:28:34,118
I only ever wanted you to be a mom.

278
00:28:34,635 --> 00:28:37,343
Not a model or an "ageless beauty."

279
00:28:37,368 --> 00:28:39,993
A proper mom.
That's all I wanted.

280
00:28:42,556 --> 00:28:47,577
I'll never forgive you if you abandon Papa.

281
00:29:02,035 --> 00:29:07,577
Five years ago...?
Yes, I more or less remember.

282
00:29:09,969 --> 00:29:11,636
Any problems?

283
00:29:11,961 --> 00:29:14,711
Nothing I can recall...

284
00:29:16,489 --> 00:29:18,303
Could you look them up?

285
00:29:38,069 --> 00:29:41,823
PM 06:51 TST

286
00:29:49,986 --> 00:29:51,377
Sorry about this morning.

287
00:29:53,450 --> 00:29:56,952
It’s fine. I know how you feel. Thanks.

288
00:30:24,827 --> 00:30:25,796
Come in.

289
00:30:42,285 --> 00:30:43,618
Good to see you.

290
00:30:56,016 --> 00:30:57,235
I missed you.

291
00:31:02,149 --> 00:31:07,169
Emergencies... 2021...

292
00:31:08,952 --> 00:31:09,785
This is it.

293
00:31:19,807 --> 00:31:20,856
You've suffered.

294
00:31:22,517 --> 00:31:23,816
Help me forget.

295
00:31:52,635 --> 00:31:54,052
Any information?

296
00:31:54,177 --> 00:31:59,027
I'm sending you the examination records
from that day.

297
00:31:59,052 --> 00:32:00,260
Thanks.

298
00:32:00,324 --> 00:32:03,383
TOKYO GENERAL MEDICAL CENTER
RUI LIN

299
00:32:16,023 --> 00:32:17,035
Gonna go shower.

300
00:33:22,118 --> 00:33:24,057
Why were you trying to find me?

301
00:33:56,256 --> 00:33:59,049
Pretty good, huh?

302
00:34:00,283 --> 00:34:03,491
Remember when she took Rui to Japan?

303
00:34:04,401 --> 00:34:06,026
I went too.

304
00:34:09,443 --> 00:34:13,568
We're still together, even now.

305
00:34:16,346 --> 00:34:19,223
Man, that body of hers...

306
00:34:19,491 --> 00:34:22,643
Easy there, you're on video.

307
00:34:28,616 --> 00:34:32,734
Think, who has the most to lose
if the truth gets out?

308
00:34:48,470 --> 00:34:49,089
How's this?

309
00:34:51,512 --> 00:34:53,303
Buy this video from me.

310
00:34:53,678 --> 00:34:58,637
You don't want to destroy
everything your trophy wife worked for.

311
00:35:59,262 --> 00:36:00,095
You okay?

312
00:36:01,345 --> 00:36:02,512
Yeah.

313
00:36:09,220 --> 00:36:11,553
-Why don't we...
-I have to go.

314
00:36:23,887 --> 00:36:25,262
NEW MESSAGE

315
00:36:26,637 --> 00:36:27,762
Who's that?

316
00:36:28,928 --> 00:36:31,428
NIIDE'S FRIEND?
I'LL SEE YOU SOON.

317
00:36:32,137 --> 00:36:33,678
What on earth...?

318
00:36:38,678 --> 00:36:41,012
WHO ARE YOU?

319
00:36:52,387 --> 00:36:54,053
Isn't that...?

320
00:36:54,887 --> 00:36:56,762
It's him! Oh man!

321
00:36:57,553 --> 00:37:00,512
-The reward money!
-I want the reward!

322
00:37:11,220 --> 00:37:13,595
100,000 YEN REWARD FOR FINDING HIM.

323
00:37:14,027 --> 00:37:15,470
I see.

324
00:37:20,656 --> 00:37:21,783
There he is!

325
00:37:24,109 --> 00:37:27,582
Wow! I just might be a genius.

326
00:37:43,387 --> 00:37:45,553
Where did you go?

327
00:37:45,678 --> 00:37:47,553
It’s none of your business.

328
00:37:48,220 --> 00:37:49,803
Wait... wait!

329
00:37:56,762 --> 00:37:59,345
She asked him about a video.

330
00:38:12,137 --> 00:38:12,970
Follow her!

331
00:38:31,053 --> 00:38:34,095
THE GAME WILL END
IF A PLAYER COMPLETES THE ASSIGNED MISSION.

332
00:39:07,887 --> 00:39:10,262
ONLY ONE SHALL PREVAIL...

333
00:39:27,200 --> 00:39:30,916
Open the door! Open the door!

334
00:39:58,336 --> 00:40:01,670
EXPOSE THE SEX VIDEO
WITH YOUR AFFAIR PARTNER TO THE LIGHT OF DAY

335
00:40:06,678 --> 00:40:09,220
CONFIRM UPLOAD?

336
00:40:11,763 --> 00:40:14,928
Open up! I know you're in there!

337
00:40:16,699 --> 00:40:18,365
Open the door!

338
00:40:24,262 --> 00:40:26,887
Not a model or an "ageless beauty."

339
00:40:27,012 --> 00:40:29,220
A proper mom.
That's all I wanted.

340
00:40:37,053 --> 00:40:40,637
UPLOAD IN PROGRESS

341
00:40:52,416 --> 00:40:56,203
-Hey, where did he go?
-That way, I guess?

342
00:41:00,563 --> 00:41:01,396
Found you.

343
00:41:06,938 --> 00:41:08,980
Give it up!

344
00:41:19,480 --> 00:41:20,373
Open!

345
00:41:23,333 --> 00:41:24,166
What?

346
00:41:32,313 --> 00:41:34,521
-Wait... wait!
-No stop!

347
00:41:38,146 --> 00:41:41,605
-I’m sorry.
-Wait! Give us some time!

348
00:41:42,771 --> 00:41:45,271
Let me be a good mother, just this once!

349
00:41:45,688 --> 00:41:47,105
UPLOAD IN PROGRESS

350
00:41:47,480 --> 00:41:51,146
If the game ends now,
they’ll kill the other hostages!

351
00:41:54,396 --> 00:41:55,646
Wait.

352
00:41:58,111 --> 00:42:00,423
-Please, let her!
-Get off!

353
00:42:00,448 --> 00:42:02,865
Let Mom save Papa! Please!

354
00:42:04,063 --> 00:42:06,438
Don't try to stop her!

355
00:42:07,896 --> 00:42:10,089
Out of the way! Let go!

356
00:42:10,849 --> 00:42:13,182
-Hey!
-Don't do this to us!

357
00:42:14,938 --> 00:42:19,216
UPLOAD IN PROGRESS

358
00:42:35,230 --> 00:42:37,813
UPLOAD CANCELED

359
00:42:38,646 --> 00:42:41,355
Why?

360
00:42:51,445 --> 00:43:02,810
Why? Why?!

361
00:43:03,033 --> 00:43:05,242
THE FILES HAVE BEEN DELETED.

362
00:43:12,646 --> 00:43:14,688
Made it...

363
00:43:19,521 --> 00:43:22,605
I can't afford this game to end yet.

364
00:43:24,688 --> 00:43:27,771
RYOHEI HYODO

365
00:43:35,980 --> 00:43:37,646
Why won't you answer?

366
00:43:56,771 --> 00:44:00,643
Please... Save Papa, I beg you...

367
00:44:01,980 --> 00:44:11,855
Please... Save Papa!

368
00:44:18,855 --> 00:44:21,313
Please... Save Papa!

369
00:44:45,396 --> 00:44:47,646
Calm down. Calm down.

370
00:44:48,355 --> 00:44:50,730
Let me see that, please.

371
00:45:06,438 --> 00:45:07,563
I'm sorry.

372
00:45:11,730 --> 00:45:14,271
Please... please.

373
00:45:14,522 --> 00:45:15,863
There is nothing I can do.

374
00:45:37,188 --> 00:45:46,696
Murderer! Give me back my Papa!

375
00:45:48,447 --> 00:45:52,616
Give me back my Papa!

376
00:46:05,146 --> 00:46:08,563
AM 05:50 TST

377
00:46:25,483 --> 00:46:26,370
You okay?

378
00:46:28,337 --> 00:46:32,649
Managed to shake off the police somehow.
And you?

379
00:46:33,993 --> 00:46:35,666
The men got away.

380
00:46:38,087 --> 00:46:39,670
What happened?

381
00:46:41,059 --> 00:46:43,420
The video was suddenly deleted.

382
00:46:44,337 --> 00:46:48,837
-How?
-Dunno... Someone might have interfered...

383
00:46:52,420 --> 00:46:54,754
To stop her from completing her mission?

384
00:46:54,879 --> 00:46:57,045
That's all I can think of...

385
00:46:58,545 --> 00:47:04,212
Completing the mission and interfering
both kill people. What are we supposed to do?

386
00:47:04,504 --> 00:47:06,462
They're enjoying this.

387
00:47:14,629 --> 00:47:18,795
Did you find anything out?

388
00:47:19,927 --> 00:47:23,976
Nothing of note in the patient records.

389
00:47:25,045 --> 00:47:26,337
I see.

390
00:47:28,837 --> 00:47:32,712
There's one more thing I want to ask you...

391
00:47:37,420 --> 00:47:42,212
There's someone at reception to see you.

392
00:47:42,337 --> 00:47:43,504
Who?

393
00:47:43,837 --> 00:47:45,920
A young man.

394
00:47:46,045 --> 00:47:49,920
But something seems off about him...

395
00:47:51,212 --> 00:47:55,295
-Tell security not to let him escape.
-Okay.

396
00:48:15,410 --> 00:48:16,837
We meet at last.

397
00:48:19,490 --> 00:48:22,087
So you're the famous Akina Isobe.

398
00:48:23,269 --> 00:48:28,629
Niide's friend... or Saori's?

399
00:48:29,212 --> 00:48:30,379
You...

400
00:48:31,295 --> 00:48:33,212
Are you a hothead too?

401
00:48:35,420 --> 00:48:36,962
Why are you here?

402
00:48:39,420 --> 00:48:41,379
I've brought you a scoop.

403
00:48:44,707 --> 00:48:46,062
What do you want to know?

404
00:48:47,210 --> 00:48:49,710
About the link between us.

405
00:48:50,310 --> 00:48:51,754
It could be a clue.

406
00:49:00,754 --> 00:49:06,816
"Since you continue to act like a fool,
I have prepared a new stage for you."

407
00:49:10,584 --> 00:49:12,418
"A new stage"?
